## 4. Acceptance Criteria & Milestones

| Milestone | Stage | Exit Criteria |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **M1: Proof-of-Process & Human MVP** | Stage 1 | 100% of printed packet scans rectify accurately; blank boxes auto-score to `0`; tutors grade inked crops via one-click `.md` rubric checklists; `Result` and `TestSummary` scores update automatically upon audit resolution.

 |
| **M2: Shadow AI Calibration** | Stage 2 | Conditional dual-VLM + `casVerifier.ts` pre-populates rubric checklists; tutors review and override AI suggestions; telemetry logs criterion-level agreement across $\ge 200$ audited sub-parts. |
| **M3: Autonomous Production** | Stage 3 | Point-level agreement exceeds **99.0%** in Stage 2; `STAGE_3_AUTONOMOUS` enabled; human audit queue handles only deterministic CAS/VLM exceptions (<5–8% of crops) and student disputes. 